      <div class="cs-section-body">
        <p class="project-description">
          I built a design system of 25+ standardized components, meeting WCAG 2.2
          Level AA at the component level and backed by Figma tokens so it scales.
        </p>
        <Image
          src={sageFoundations}
          alt="UT Sage foundations"
          width={1518}
          quality={100}
          class="rounded-xl object-cover"
        />
        <Image
          src={sageButtons}
          alt="UT Sage buttons"
          width={2400}
          quality={100}
          class="rounded-xl object-cover"
        />
        <Image
          src={sageExampleComponents}
