        </ul>
      </div>

      <SectionHeading
        index="05"
        title="Validation & results"
        id="validation-and-results"
      />
      <div class="cs-section-body">
        <p class="project-description">
          After nine months, I delivered a more accessible, unified prototype, and
          engineers used the design system to rebuild pages quickly and consistently.
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-8 items-center">
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
            <strong>Home screen</strong>
            <Image
              src={sageHomepageProduction}
              alt="UT Sage homepage production"
              width={2400}
              quality={100}
              class="rounded-xl object-cover"
            />
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
            <strong>Edit screen</strong>
            <Image
              src={sageEditPageProduction}
              alt="UT Sage edit page production"
              width={2400}
              quality={100}
              class="rounded-xl object-cover"
            />
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
            <strong>Chat screen</strong>
            <Image
              src={sageChatPageProduction}
              alt="UT Sage chat page production"
              width={2400}
              quality={100}
              class="rounded-xl object-cover"
            />
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <SectionHeading index="06" title="Outcomes" id="outcomes" />
      <div class="cs-section-body">
        <p class="project-description">
          UT Sage went from a half-finished beta to a coherent, accessible platform.
        </p>
        <Points numbered={false}>
          <Point title="Accessibility">
            <p>WCAG 2.2 Level AA across all components: contrast, font sizing, and keyboard navigation.</p>
          </Point>
          <Point title="Consistency">
            <p>25+ components with Figma tokens keep design consistent across the platform.</p>
          </Point>
          <Point title="Developer efficiency">
            <p>Engineers build pages significantly faster.</p>
          </Point>
          <Point title="Design sustainability">
            <p>New features can be designed quickly on the same system.</p>
          </Point>
        </Points>
      </div>

      <SectionHeading
        index="07"
        title="Reflection & next steps"
        id="reflection-and-next-steps"
